661
00:43:08,340 --> 00:43:12,040
When the crew is on call, the DC-10 can be filled and launched

662
00:43:12,140 --> 00:43:15,060
in less than an hour.

663
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:17,360
It then approaches the firefighters

664
00:43:17,460 --> 00:43:19,620
